# The server signals after the gang accepts payment. Use real keys and the ordinary game clock.
cadence normal
waitai broken road_walk 180000
release all
walkmode walk
hold forward 1500
wait 2500
hold back 1500
wait 2500
hold forward 1500
wait 2500
hold back 1500
wait 2500
hold forward 1500
wait 2500
hold back 1500
wait 2500
release all
